  <h2 class="brief-keep">Creating a platform for Culture, Strategy, and Growth</h2>
  <p class="brief-keep">The goal of this site is to create a platform which will act as a foundation for culture, strategy, and growth. This is achieved by sharing news and tools that give the audience the content needed to understand what success means to the company, and what it looks like for the individual.</p>

  <h2 class="brief-keep">Existing content</h2>
  <p class="brief-keep">One of the requirements of this new site was to continue the success of the previous one with new content and features to support our strategy for the new platform.</p>
  <p class="brief-keep">Looking at the type of content currently being shared, and what worked was a key step in our process to gather the relevant content to be shared in the new site.</p>
  <figure class="brief-keep"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1551916440221-blur-content.png" alt="Existing content review" loading="lazy" /></figure>

  <h3 class="brief-keep">Interviews</h3>
  <p class="brief-keep">Interviews were conducted with 22 users, and 8 project stakeholders/contributors. Questions asked during the interviews pertained to how they felt about the current site, what they wanted to see, and how they are currently using the site in their daily routine.</p>
  <p class="brief-keep">Some of our key takeaways from the interviews showed us trends in the understanding of the company's strategy, culture, growth, and communication.</p>
  <figure class="brief-only"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1551918686685-Screen-Shot-2019-03-06-at-6.31.03-PM.png" alt="Interview takeaways" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <figure class="bare"><img src="/assets/img/emit/interview-takeaways.webp" alt="The four trends from the interviews — strategy, culture, career development (formerly learning) and communication" loading="lazy" /></figure>

  <h3 class="brief-keep">Personas</h3>
  <p class="brief-keep">These findings were used to create personas to understand what type of content the audience values, what they expect to see, and how the site is used in their day to day work flow. Using this knowledge that we've uncovered, we planned for a workshop to review personas, card sorting, and experience mapping.</p>
  <figure class="brief-only"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552018600038-personas.png" alt="Personas" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <figure><img src="/assets/img/emit/personas.webp" alt="The five original personas — self-improvement, skeptical, new hire, manager and ITSCM — each with core problems, value proposition and pre/post objectives" loading="lazy" /></figure>

  <h3 class="brief-keep">Content strategy</h3>
  <p class="brief-keep">Responses taken from stakeholder interviews have been combined to understand the general consensus on topics relating to content currently being provided by the site.</p>
  <figure class="brief-keep"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552022534291-Affinity-mapping.png" alt="Affinity mapping" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <p class="brief-keep">We conducted a joint work session to foster an agreement among stakeholders and the agency on what content should be on the site. Card sorting existing content was a part of this workshop, as well as experience mapping.</p>
  <figure class="brief-keep"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552431848286-workshop-image.png" alt="Workshop" loading="lazy" /></figure>

  <h2 class="brief-keep">Strategy for new site</h2>
  <p class="brief-keep">Our goals for the information architecture is to easily complete objectives, maintain and improve the findability of key information, and promote exploration of content.</p>
  <figure class="brief-keep"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552434503961-website-strategy.png" alt="Website strategy" loading="lazy" /></figure>

  <h3 class="brief-keep">Themes to remember</h3>
  <h3 class="brief-keep">Culture</h3>
  <ul class="brief-keep">
    <li>Provide transparency and clarity</li>
    <li>Recognizing our success and celebrating progress</li>
    <li>Highlighting empowerment to decision spaces</li>
    <li>Outlet to further career path enlightenment</li>
    <li>Humanizing our leaders</li>
  </ul>
  <h3 class="brief-keep">Strategy</h3>
  <ul class="brief-keep">
    <li>Articulating the vision and strategic direction</li>
    <li>Continually updating organization on changes and progress against the strategic direction</li>
    <li>Highlighting stories of groups turning strategic elements into reality</li>
  </ul>
  <h3 class="brief-keep">Career growth</h3>
  <ul class="brief-keep">
    <li>Reinforce growth mindset with a hierarchical emphasis on learning</li>
    <li>Provide a collection of learning opportunities across the organization - a hub to link to other sites</li>
    <li>Become the go-to digital platform for new learning announcements</li>
  </ul>
  <figure class="brief-keep"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552436830162-december-ia.png" alt="Information architecture" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <p class="brief-keep">Existing content is tagged to fall under categories that make sense for the audience. This chart also serves as a guide to place new content in its respective categories.</p>
  <figure class="brief-keep"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552514505981-14_Tagging.jpg" alt="Content tagging" loading="lazy" /></figure>

  <h2 class="brief-keep">Community</h2>
  <p class="brief-keep">We wanted the site to be the go-to source for all news and strategy needs. In order to create that type of culture we need to foster a sense of community within the company.</p>
  <p class="brief-keep">We do that with stories and videos that encourage teams to get to know each other and reach out for meaningful conversations.</p>
  <figure class="brief-only"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552519016380-stories.jpg" alt="Stories" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <figure><img src="/assets/img/emit/stories.webp" alt="The original stories and videos library — filterable by culture, strategy, tech, business and career growth" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <h3 class="brief-keep">About pages and communities</h3>
  <figure class="brief-only"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552516328824-values.png" alt="Values page" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <figure><img src="/assets/img/emit/about.webp" alt="The original About page — who the organization is, its communities and groups" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <h3 class="brief-keep">Meet the team</h3>
  <figure class="brief-only"><img src="/assets/img/archive/1552517108693-leadership.png" alt="Leadership page" loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <figure><img src="/assets/img/emit/leadership.webp" alt="The original leadership page — a letter from leadership and the team grid, blurred" loading="lazy" /></figure>

  <h2 class="brief-keep">Plans for future content</h2>
  <p class="brief-keep">Initial launch of the internal site was successful in organizing and making communities successful. Plans for future content will include for more "One on Ones" interviews with the leadership and a dedicated team to manage fresh content that will serve the organizations interests as well as encourage career growth and a team oriented culture.</p>
